    "title": "Erie Bell Game at Middletown High School Today",
    "text": "21 hours ago The annual Erie Bell football game between the Port Jervis Raiders and the Middletown Middies will be played on Saturday, September 26 at 1:00 PM at Faller Field at Middletown High School . Port Jervis will try to keep the Erie Bell trophy in its possession, with players, coaches, cheerleaders, and band members all taking part.\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Port Jervis Police Department\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
